    "display_name": "Food Delivery App Receipt",
    "long_instructions": "## Digital Artifact\r\n\r\n1. Examine the artifact to the right.\r\n2. Find example(s) of **Public**, **Private**, and **Sensitive** data and add it to the table in your Activity Guide.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "A receipt from last night's dinner delivery",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
